                                "sense_id": "65342d2e-7676-3ba8-903b-e2fc24b6614d",
                                "text": "His horror became a madness ; his eyes ran gleamingly along the shore, to detect the demon hand that had in the very moment of his bliss struck from his heart the living impulse of his soul."
                            }
